// disc). The effect turns the table by a random angle, scales it
// up, keeps the points that fall on the picture and deals them out shuffled,
// one to each drop, see WaterDrops::NextLandingPlace. So the drops land spread
// evenly, never in clumps and never leaving holes, and no two showers land the
// same.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
